WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.7 · Theory of Change
Inputs

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Inputs are every resource your activities need, including time, skills and permissions.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Count volunteer time and permissions, not only money.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Separate what you have from what you need.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Link each gap to an internal objective.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Working capital for a month's yarn, the designer's time, online shop fees. Main gap: working capital.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your resource plan: what you have, what is missing.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
